Third-party data bundled with orcad2kicad
==========================================

This directory contains symbol-library files redistributed from the KiCad
project so that the `--kicad-power` and `--kicad-rc` conversion options work
without a local KiCad installation (e.g. when the converter runs in a browser
via Pyodide). The orcad2kicad code itself is MIT-licensed; these data files are
NOT — they keep their upstream license below.

power.kicad_sym
    Verbatim copy of KiCad's power symbol library.

Device.kicad_sym
    A reduced copy containing only the "R" and "C" symbols extracted from
    KiCad's Device symbol library (the only two the converter uses).

Source:  KiCad Libraries — https://gitlab.com/kicad/libraries/kicad-symbols
License: Creative Commons CC-BY-SA 4.0 with the KiCad Library Exception.
