The embedded font advance tables (../text_metrics_data.py) are derived metrics
(numbers), not font outlines. The Arial / Arial Narrow / Courier New figures are
measured from the metric-compatible Liberation fonts (Liberation Sans / Sans
Narrow / Mono; OFL-1.1, the Narrow face GPL-2.0 + font exception) — no proprietary
font is used. The Newstroke figures come from KiCad's newstroke_font.cpp (KiCad,
GPL-2.0-or-later). See gen_text_metrics.py.
